{"name":"Ray Peat diet","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":18,"casual":{"lead":["The Ray Peat diet is built around milk, fruit and juice, root vegetables, eggs, shellfish and saturated fats while avoiding polyunsaturated fats. Followers say it raises metabolism and balances hormones.","No clinical trials of the diet were found. Forum discussion mixes enthusiastic reports with scepticism."],"sections":[{"h":"How it works","paras":["Proponents say lowering PUFA intake and eating sugar-rich, dairy-rich foods supports thyroid function and metabolic rate and lowers estrogen. These mechanisms have not been tested in published studies of the diet."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks and caveats","paras":["No harms were documented in the sources reviewed. Users in forums mention hormone-related side effects anecdotally, and extreme claims such as height gain are unsupported by published research."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"RAY PEAT inspired post.","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ray-peat-inspired-post.2114091/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260714170956/https://looksmax.org/threads/ray-peat-inspired-post.2114091/"},{"title":"Ray Peat gained at least an inch in his 40s with DHEA","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ray-peat-gained-at-least-an-inch-in-his-40s-with-dhea.1005348/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240509174113/https://looksmax.org/threads/ray-peat-gained-at-least-an-inch-in-his-40s-with-dhea.1005348/"},{"title":"Ray Peat diet turned me straight","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ray-peat-diet-turned-me-straight.877815/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20241121024011/https://looksmax.org/threads/ray-peat-diet-turned-me-straight.877815/"},{"title":"ray peat resource list resources to optimise metabolic rate hormones and health","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ray-peat-resource-list-resources-